        "margin_bottom": 68,
        "title": "Why We Combine CBN with CBD and Mushrooms",
        "subtitle": "<p>Cannabinoids rarely work in isolation as effectively as they do in combination. This principle—the entourage effect—is why our <a href=\"https://hemplucid.com/products/functional-gummies-sleep-cbd-cbn-mushroom\" target=\"_blank\">Sleep CBD + CBN + Mushroom Gummies</a> pair CBN with CBD and Reishi mushroom extract:<br/><br/></p>",
